<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Saturday at the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, final</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Mary Pierce (France) 6-2 6-2</p>
